  "profile_interpretation": "Phase buckets overlap enclosing Jacobian/residual buckets. In the reuse-on case, closure mapping takes about 79.3% of stepping wall time, numerical Jacobian assembly 71.0%, dynamics preparation 9.2%, and outer Newton factorization 0.12%. This does not isolate the cost of SVD within mapping.",
